{"seq":1,"slug":"clipboard-read-write","title":"剪贴板读写 API","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-clipboard-dragdrop/clipboard/clipboard-read-write","wordCount":1074,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"剪贴板读写-api\">剪贴板读写 API</h1><p>多年来「复制到剪贴板」在前端是一段尴尬的历史：先是 Flash 垫片，后是 <code>document.execCommand(&#39;copy&#39;)</code> 配一个隐藏的 <code>textarea</code>——同步、阻塞、只能处理纯文本、还得趁焦点没丢赶紧执行。直到 Async Clipboard API 成熟，并在 2025 年 3 月于三大浏览器引擎达到 Baseline Newly Available，前端才终于有了一套现代、异步、支持任意数据的剪贴板接口（详见 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Clipboard_API\">MDN Clipboard API</a>）。本篇讲这套 API 的四个核心方法、它们的快慢两条路径、以及务必处理好的失败模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-四个方法-两条路径\">核心概念：四个方法，两条路径</h2><p><code>navigator.clipboard</code> 暴露四个方法，分成「文本快捷路径」和「通用路径」两组。文本路径（<code>readText</code>/<code>writeText</code>）参数和返回都是字符串，写复制按钮够用且最省事；通用路径（<code>read</code>/<code>write</code>）操作 <code>ClipboardItem</code>，能处理图片、富文本、多格式，是后续<a href=\"rich-clipboard\">富内容与多格式</a>的基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[navigator.clipboard] --&gt; B[文本快捷路径]&#10;  A --&gt; C[通用路径]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[writeText 字符串 → 剪贴板]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[readText 剪贴板 → 字符串]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[write ClipboardItem 数组 → 剪贴板]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[read → ClipboardItem 数组]&#10;  B1 --&gt; D[全部返回 Promise&lt;br/&gt;需 await]&#10;  B2 --&gt; D&#10;  C1 --&gt; D&#10;  C2 --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n  A[navigator.clipboard] --&gt; B[文本快捷路径]\n  A --&gt; C[通用路径]\n  B --&gt; B1[writeText 字符串 → 剪贴板]\n  B --&gt; B2[readText 剪贴板 → 字符串]\n  C --&gt; C1[write ClipboardItem 数组 → 剪贴板]\n  C --&gt; C2[read → ClipboardItem 数组]\n  B1 --&gt; D[全部返回 Promise&lt;br/&gt;需 await]\n  B2 --&gt; D\n  C1 --&gt; D\n  C2 --&gt; D</pre><p>四个方法全部返回 Promise——这是它们与旧 <code>execCommand</code> 的本质区别，也是名字里「Async」的由来。异步的好处是不阻塞主线程、能配合权限弹窗；代价是必须在用户手势的瞬时激活窗口内发起，这个约束在<a href=\"../foundations/clipboard-permissions\">剪贴板权限与安全</a>已详述。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>writeText(s)</code></td>\n<td>字符串</td>\n<td><code>Promise&lt;void&gt;</code></td>\n<td>复制一段文字</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>readText()</code></td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td><code>Promise&lt;string&gt;</code></td>\n<td>读纯文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>write(items)</code></td>\n<td><code>ClipboardItem[]</code></td>\n<td><code>Promise&lt;void&gt;</code></td>\n<td>复制图片/富文本/多格式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>read(opts?)</code></td>\n<td>可选选项</td>\n<td><code>Promise&lt;ClipboardItem[]&gt;</code></td>\n<td>读任意格式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"writetext-最常用的一行\">writeText：最常用的一行</h2><p>绝大多数「复制」需求——复制邀请码、复制 URL、复制一段代码——用 <code>writeText</code> 一行搞定。它必须在用户手势回调里 <code>await</code>，并用 try/catch 兜住失败给出反馈。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"copyBtn.addEventListener(&#39;click&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;  try {&#10;    await navigator.clipboard.writeText(inviteCode);&#10;    showToast(&#39;已复制&#39;);&#10;  } catch (err) {&#10;    // 多半是 NotAllowedError（非安全上下文/无手势/被拒）&#10;    showToast(&#39;复制失败，请手动选择&#39;);&#10;    console.error(err);&#10;  }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">copyBtn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'click'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigator.clipboard.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">writeText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(inviteCode);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    showToast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'已复制'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (err) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 多半是 NotAllowedError（非安全上下文/无手势/被拒）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    showToast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'复制失败，请手动选择'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(err);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一个常见错误是把 <code>writeText</code> 当同步用、不处理 Promise——一旦失败你既不知道、用户也得不到反馈，他点了按钮以为复制成功，粘贴出来却是上一次的内容。永远要 <code>await</code> 加 try/catch。</p>\n<h2 id=\"readtext-与-read-读取的两种粒度\">readText 与 read：读取的两种粒度</h2><p>读纯文本用 <code>readText</code>，它返回剪贴板当前的纯文本表示。要注意读取在 Chromium 系会触发权限检查甚至弹窗，所以最好仅在用户明确发起（如点「粘贴」按钮）时调用，而非页面加载就偷偷读。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"pasteBtn.addEventListener(&#39;click&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;  try {&#10;    const text = await navigator.clipboard.readText();&#10;    input.value = text;&#10;  } catch (err) {&#10;    console.warn(&#39;读取剪贴板被拒或无内容&#39;, err);&#10;  }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pasteBtn.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'click'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigator.clipboard.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">readText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    input.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> text;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (err) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">warn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'读取剪贴板被拒或无内容'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, err);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>read()</code> 则返回 <code>ClipboardItem</code> 数组，每个 item 通过 <code>item.types</code> 暴露它含有的 MIME 类型，再用 <code>item.getType(type)</code> 异步取出对应的 Blob。这是读图片、读富文本的通用入口：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const items = await navigator.clipboard.read();&#10;for (const item of items) {&#10;  if (item.types.includes(&#39;image/png&#39;)) {&#10;    const blob = await item.getType(&#39;image/png&#39;);&#10;    img.src = URL.createObjectURL(blob);&#10;  } else if (item.types.includes(&#39;text/plain&#39;)) {&#10;    const blob = await item.getType(&#39;text/plain&#39;);&#10;    console.log(await blob.text());&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigator.clipboard.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">read</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (item.types.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'image/png'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> blob</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'image/png'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    img.src </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createObjectURL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(blob);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (item.types.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'text/plain'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> blob</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'text/plain'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blob.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>getType</code> 本身也返回 Promise——剪贴板里的数据是惰性取出的，只有你真正要某个格式时才去取。各格式 MIME 类型的含义见<a href=\"../foundations/transfer-data-formats\">传输数据格式</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"write-写入通用负载\">write：写入通用负载</h2><p><code>write</code> 接收一个 <code>ClipboardItem</code> 数组，用于写文本以外的内容。最简单的例子是复制一张 canvas 渲染的图片到剪贴板：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"canvas.toBlob(async (blob) =&gt; {&#10;  try {&#10;    await navigator.clipboard.write([new ClipboardItem({ &#39;image/png&#39;: blob })]);&#10;    showToast(&#39;图片已复制&#39;);&#10;  } catch (err) {&#10;    showToast(&#39;复制图片失败&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;}, &#39;image/png&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">canvas.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBlob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">blob</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigator.clipboard.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ClipboardItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'image/png'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: blob })]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    showToast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'图片已复制'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (err) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    showToast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'复制图片失败'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'image/png'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>write</code> 真正的威力在于一个 <code>ClipboardItem</code> 可以同时携带多种格式（纯文本、HTML、图片打包在一起），以及用惰性 Promise 应对瞬时激活过期——这两块是<a href=\"rich-clipboard\">富内容与多格式</a>的主题，本篇不展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失败模式与优雅降级\">失败模式与优雅降级</h2><p>剪贴板调用失败是常态而非例外，务必为每条路径准备降级。最常见的异常是 <code>NotAllowedError</code>（非安全上下文、缺手势、权限被拒），其次是某些浏览器对某格式不支持时的 <code>NotSupportedError</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"async function copyTextWithFallback(text) {&#10;  if (navigator.clipboard &amp;&amp; window.isSecureContext) {&#10;    try {&#10;      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);&#10;      return true;&#10;    } catch {&#10;      /* 落到下面的兜底 */&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  // 兜底：旧 execCommand 路径（已废弃但仍可作为最后退路）&#10;  const ta = document.createElement(&#39;textarea&#39;);&#10;  ta.value = text;&#10;  ta.style.position = &#39;fixed&#39;;&#10;  ta.style.opacity = &#39;0&#39;;&#10;  document.body.appendChild(ta);&#10;  ta.select();&#10;  const ok = document.execCommand(&#39;copy&#39;);&#10;  ta.remove();&#10;  return ok;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> copyTextWithFallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (navigator.clipboard </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window.isSecureContext) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigator.clipboard.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">writeText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(text);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      /* 落到下面的兜底 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 兜底：旧 execCommand 路径（已废弃但仍可作为最后退路）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ta</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'textarea'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ta.value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> text;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ta.style.position </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fixed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ta.style.opacity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  document.body.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">appendChild</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ta);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ta.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ok</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">execCommand</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'copy'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ta.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">remove</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ok;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个「先试现代 API、失败退回 execCommand」的两段式，是 2026 年仍然推荐的稳健写法——现代 API 覆盖绝大多数情况，execCommand 兜住极少数老环境。各浏览器具体在哪些点上会失败，归<a href=\"../practice/cross-browser-clipboard\">跨浏览器兼容</a>系统梳理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Async Clipboard API 2025 年 3 月达到 Baseline，提供 <code>readText</code>/<code>writeText</code>（文本快捷路径）与 <code>read</code>/<code>write</code>（通用路径）四个方法，全部异步返回 Promise。</li>\n<li><code>writeText</code> 是最常用的一行，但必须在用户手势内 <code>await</code> 并用 try/catch 兜失败，否则用户会得到「假装成功」的错觉。</li>\n<li>读取（<code>readText</code>/<code>read</code>）在 Chromium 会触发权限检查，应仅在用户明确发起时调用；<code>read</code> 通过 <code>item.types</code> + <code>getType</code> 惰性取各格式。</li>\n<li><code>write</code> 用 <code>ClipboardItem</code> 写文本以外的内容；它的多格式打包与惰性填充能力留给富内容篇。</li>\n<li>剪贴板失败是常态，推荐「现代 API + execCommand 兜底」两段式降级。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章下一篇：<a href=\"rich-clipboard\">富内容与多格式</a> — <code>ClipboardItem</code> 的多格式打包与惰性 Promise。</li>\n<li>基础章：<a href=\"../foundations/clipboard-permissions\">剪贴板权限与安全</a> — 这些方法为何会抛 <code>NotAllowedError</code>。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../browser-and-web-api/storage-apis/localstorage-and-indexeddb\">浏览器存储与持久化</a> — 剪贴板之外、页面内持久化数据的其它通道。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Clipboard_API\">MDN: Clipboard API</a> ｜ <a href=\"https://caniuse.com/async-clipboard\">caniuse: async-clipboard</a></p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"剪贴板读写 API","id":"剪贴板读写-api"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：四个方法，两条路径","id":"核心概念-四个方法-两条路径"},{"level":2,"text":"writeText：最常用的一行","id":"writetext-最常用的一行"},{"level":2,"text":"readText 与 read：读取的两种粒度","id":"readtext-与-read-读取的两种粒度"},{"level":2,"text":"write：写入通用负载","id":"write-写入通用负载"},{"level":2,"text":"失败模式与优雅降级","id":"失败模式与优雅降级"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"传输数据格式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-clipboard-dragdrop/foundations/transfer-data-formats"},"next":{"title":"富内容与多格式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-clipboard-dragdrop/clipboard/rich-clipboard"}}